{"id":49938,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=49938"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:40:29","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:40:29","slug":"meia-maratona-de-sevilha","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-de-sevilha\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona de Sevilha 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona de Sevilha 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona de Sevilha 2026<\/strong> (Medio Marat\u00f3n de Sevilla) \u00e9 aclamada como a meia maratona mais plana e veloz do continente europeu, atraindo anualmente mais de 15.000 corredores de topo mundial e milhares de atletas portugueses \u00e0 capital da Andaluzia, em <strong>Espanha<\/strong>. O percurso de <strong>21,097 km<\/strong> \u00e9 homologado pela RFEA e World Athletics.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada no emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Paseo de las Delicias<\/strong> e passagem diante da monumental Plaza de Espa\u00f1a, Torre del Oro, Rio Guadalquivir e a Catedral de Sevilha, a prova proporciona condi\u00e7\u00f5es perfeitas para bater recordes pessoais. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do <strong>Club de Atletismo San Pablo<\/strong> e da Create SL garante abastecimentos com isot\u00f3nico a cada 5 km, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica premium, medalha finisher com grava\u00e7\u00e3o e uma recep\u00e7\u00e3o festiva calorosa.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">29 de Novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Paseo de las Delicias, Sevilha, Espanha, Espanha<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Meia Maratona (21.097 km)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Club de Atletismo San Pablo \/ Create SL<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Pro